WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.083
- Are you ready?

00:00:01.083 --> 00:00:01.916
- We're ready!

00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:03.159
- Yeah!
- Let's go!

00:00:03.159 --> 00:00:06.527
- Nina's having fun. Go, Nina! Woo!

00:00:06.527 --> 00:00:10.694
- Yay! Happy birthday to me. (laughs)

00:00:17.623 --> 00:00:19.257
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

00:00:19.257 --> 00:00:21.802
- Welcome to day four.
- Is it day four?

00:00:21.802 --> 00:00:26.249
- Day four. Heading off
to the Magic Kingdom!

00:00:26.249 --> 00:00:29.166
And we also need to sing something.

00:00:30.427 --> 00:00:33.845
♫ Happy birthday to you.
(Nina laughs)

00:00:33.845 --> 00:00:38.390
Guys. ♫ Happy birthday to you.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.019
- [All] ♫ Happy birthday dear...

00:00:41.019 --> 00:00:43.519
- [Kids] Auntie.
- [Evan] Nina.

00:00:44.488 --> 00:00:47.905
♫ Happy birthday to you.

00:00:49.442 --> 00:00:54.068
Hey! It's Nina's birthday! We're
going to have a magical day.

00:00:54.068 --> 00:00:56.867
On our first day at Walt Disney World.

00:00:56.867 --> 00:00:59.285
No, Magic Kingdom, Magic Kingdom.

00:00:59.285 --> 00:01:02.202
(soft piano music)

00:01:07.756 --> 00:01:09.840
Okay, it is a cold day today in Florida.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.383
What, the high of 60?
- [Nina] 60.

00:01:12.383 --> 00:01:13.899
- 60.
- [Nina] 60.

00:01:13.899 --> 00:01:17.636
- 60, which is 16. 60
Fahrenheit, 16 Celsius.

00:01:17.636 --> 00:01:19.151
- [Nina] It's 14.

00:01:19.151 --> 00:01:21.978
- No, it's not even 14,
now. It's like 9 right now.

00:01:21.978 --> 00:01:24.144
Yeah, it's cold, but it's warming up.

00:01:24.144 --> 00:01:28.311
It's okay. Better than
what's happening in Toronto.

00:01:29.163 --> 00:01:30.501
Are we ready to have a what day?

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:31.708
What kind of day are we going to have?

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.486
- [Nina] Magic.
- [Hayden] A magical day!

00:01:33.486 --> 00:01:34.996
- [Evan] Alright. Let's go.

00:01:34.996 --> 00:01:38.237
- With super-Hayden, the wizard!

00:01:38.237 --> 00:01:41.207
- [Evan] Alright, I like it.
Okay, this way. Let's go.

00:01:41.207 --> 00:01:43.790
(upbeat music)

00:01:59.056 --> 00:02:02.394
Alright. Nina's going to go
take the kids to Aladdin,

00:02:02.394 --> 00:02:05.105
and I am going to go get her a coffee.

00:02:05.105 --> 00:02:07.645
A special birthday coffee to warm up.

00:02:07.645 --> 00:02:08.606
- Yeah, it's cold.

00:02:08.606 --> 00:02:10.309
- I'm going to get a
coffee for myself, too.

00:02:10.309 --> 00:02:14.499
Okay, bye kids! Go with
Nina, go with Nina!

00:02:14.499 --> 00:02:16.501
(elegant music)

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:19.250
Alright. Got the coffees.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.464
Venti caramel macchiato for Nina,

00:02:21.464 --> 00:02:24.631
venti green tea matcha...latte for me.

00:02:27.549 --> 00:02:29.303
That was a crazy-long lineup.

00:02:29.303 --> 00:02:31.591
Nina went on one ride with the kids

00:02:31.591 --> 00:02:34.639
and is on the second ride with the kids.

00:02:34.639 --> 00:02:36.720
The lineup at Starbucks is longer than

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.515
the lineups to go at the
rides at Walt Disney World.

00:02:39.515 --> 00:02:41.910
That's the world we live in.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.139
Well, Nina's going to be
happy, it's her birthday,

00:02:44.139 --> 00:02:47.071
she needs a warm drink,
so that's how we do it.

00:02:47.071 --> 00:02:49.823
Look who I found! How was it?

00:02:49.823 --> 00:02:50.701
- Good! Good.

00:02:50.701 --> 00:02:54.114
- [Evan] So you went on this
ride, Aladdin, which I missed.

00:02:54.114 --> 00:02:56.290
And then you went on Jungle
Cruise, which I missed.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:59.110
But we got Nina her coffee!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:02.026
I don't know if that's yours,
actually. I think it is.

00:03:02.026 --> 00:03:03.974
And how is it? Was it worth it?

00:03:03.974 --> 00:03:05.706
- Mm.
- [Evan] Yummy!

00:03:05.706 --> 00:03:07.965
Alright, let's keep going.

00:03:07.965 --> 00:03:09.592
(upbeat guitar music)

00:03:09.592 --> 00:03:11.043
Nina's excited. Why?

00:03:11.043 --> 00:03:12.208
- Because it's warm.

00:03:12.208 --> 00:03:15.226
- [Evan] Because it's warm
in here. We're in for a show.

00:03:15.226 --> 00:03:16.925
I wasn't allowed to film in there,

00:03:16.925 --> 00:03:18.300
but did we have a good time?

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.645
(Hayden singing)

00:03:20.645 --> 00:03:23.773
In the Tiki, Tiki, Tiki, Tiki,
Tiki Room. That was good.

00:03:23.773 --> 00:03:25.603
(Hayden singing)

00:03:25.603 --> 00:03:26.765
Let's see what's next.

00:03:26.765 --> 00:03:29.348
(fiddle music)

00:03:33.231 --> 00:03:35.071
We're ready to watch some bears.

00:03:35.071 --> 00:03:38.155
Birthday girl is all excited.

00:03:38.155 --> 00:03:40.233
Hayden is all excited.

00:03:40.233 --> 00:03:42.519
Nina wants a P-U-P-P-Y
for her birthday present.

00:03:42.519 --> 00:03:44.582
- P-U-P-P-Y (Nina laughs)

00:03:44.582 --> 00:03:46.953
- [Hayden] P-U! P-P! Y!
- But she has me.

00:03:46.953 --> 00:03:49.116
- You are my P-U-P-P-Y.

00:03:49.116 --> 00:03:51.153
- Right? We don't need to get a puppy.

00:03:51.153 --> 00:03:52.628
We need a puppy, people? You've got me.

00:03:52.628 --> 00:03:55.513
- [Hayden] Yeah. He's
also not potty trained.

00:03:55.513 --> 00:03:58.032
- I am potty trained.
(Nina laughs)

00:03:58.032 --> 00:03:59.714
Okay? Puppy may not be potty trained,

00:03:59.714 --> 00:04:02.685
but Evan is potty trained.
Very well potty trained.

00:04:02.685 --> 00:04:03.805
- Hayden is potty trained.

00:04:03.805 --> 00:04:04.852
- There's no issues there.

00:04:04.852 --> 00:04:07.435
(fiddle music)

00:04:24.323 --> 00:04:27.579
(upbeat guitar music)

00:04:27.579 --> 00:04:29.726
Okay, guys. Everybody huddle in.

00:04:29.726 --> 00:04:31.637
I have two questions for you.

00:04:31.637 --> 00:04:33.992
One: We having fun today?

00:04:33.992 --> 00:04:35.794
- Mm-hmm
- Yep.

00:04:35.794 --> 00:04:37.749
- Yeah.
- Okay. Second question.

00:04:37.749 --> 00:04:39.262
Oh, I've got three questions.

00:04:39.262 --> 00:04:41.084
Second question: Is it cold today?

00:04:41.084 --> 00:04:41.917
- Yeah!

00:04:41.917 --> 00:04:42.967
- Huh.
- Little bit.

00:04:42.967 --> 00:04:44.502
- Third question: Does that mean

00:04:44.502 --> 00:04:46.728
it's too cold for ice cream today?

00:04:46.728 --> 00:04:48.134
- [Stephanie] No!
- [Nina] Yes.

00:04:48.134 --> 00:04:50.093
(Evan laughs)

00:04:50.093 --> 00:04:53.933
- Nina's yawning a lot today.
Happy birthday, yawner.

00:04:53.933 --> 00:04:56.818
Next up, Pirates of the Caribbean!

00:04:56.818 --> 00:04:59.985
(swashbuckling music)

00:05:05.955 --> 00:05:09.332
Hayden's getting a
little too big for this.

00:05:09.332 --> 00:05:10.704
(pirate shouts, audience cheers)

00:05:10.704 --> 00:05:12.293
He's getting a little too big for this.

00:05:12.293 --> 00:05:14.588
Maybe this is the last year.

00:05:14.588 --> 00:05:16.499
I'm getting a massage after this.

00:05:16.499 --> 00:05:19.666
(swashbuckling music)

00:05:26.766 --> 00:05:28.935
- More like two horns. Ah!

00:05:28.935 --> 00:05:32.102
(swashbuckling music)

00:05:50.827 --> 00:05:52.132
- [Evan] What did we think?

00:05:52.132 --> 00:05:52.990
- Awesome!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.083
- Time to go eat some lunch, yeah!

00:05:55.083 --> 00:05:57.666
(bright music)

00:06:07.639 --> 00:06:09.232
- [Evan] It's lunch time.

00:06:09.232 --> 00:06:11.272
The boys have chicken strips. How is it?

00:06:11.272 --> 00:06:12.105
- Good.

00:06:14.768 --> 00:06:17.144
- [Evan] Stephanie, how's
the bacon cheeseburger?

00:06:17.144 --> 00:06:20.477
Yummy. We've got fries and apple slices,

00:06:21.448 --> 00:06:24.580
and we both have chicken
cheeseburgers, too.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.588
Time to eat up! Yum, yum!

00:06:26.588 --> 00:06:29.171
(bright music)

00:06:31.237 --> 00:06:33.963
So, everybody's very cold.

00:06:33.963 --> 00:06:35.575
- I'm freezing.

00:06:35.575 --> 00:06:39.372
- So we're going to spend some
time inside at the laugh floor

00:06:39.372 --> 00:06:43.007
hearing some jokes and having
a good time and getting warm.

00:06:43.007 --> 00:06:47.007
To get in here, we've got
to get into this line.

00:06:52.885 --> 00:06:56.195
I snuck out, trying to get
Nina coffee at Starbucks

00:06:56.195 --> 00:06:58.825
to just warm her up. Warm her
hands up, warm her insides.

00:06:58.825 --> 00:07:02.908
Because she's freezing.
But, lineup out the door.

00:07:04.145 --> 00:07:07.234
So, I think we'll spend
more time in that lineup

00:07:07.234 --> 00:07:09.399
than in the Monsters, Inc. line, so--

00:07:09.399 --> 00:07:13.566
Nina, we're going inside.
Nina's happy. Is it warm?

00:07:14.998 --> 00:07:15.831
- Yes!

00:07:15.831 --> 00:07:18.211
- [Evan] Alright, it's warm.

00:07:18.211 --> 00:07:20.878
(comedic music)

00:07:28.048 --> 00:07:30.215
- They're playing bachata.

00:07:31.592 --> 00:07:33.842
You want to dance? Bachata.

00:07:34.813 --> 00:07:36.061
I like the bachata.

00:07:36.061 --> 00:07:38.894
(whimsical music)

00:07:50.274 --> 00:07:52.739
- [Evan] What was your favorite part?

00:07:52.739 --> 00:07:53.701
- The fireworks.

00:07:53.701 --> 00:07:56.230
- Came back to Starbucks.
The lineup's not that bad.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:58.730
(piano music)

00:08:01.175 --> 00:08:03.466
Here's Nina! Here's Nina!

00:08:03.466 --> 00:08:05.549
She's back! How we doing?

00:08:06.593 --> 00:08:09.714
- Your green tea latte. I got a coffee.

00:08:09.714 --> 00:08:10.968
- [Evan] Thank you.

00:08:10.968 --> 00:08:13.297
(crowd noise)

00:08:13.297 --> 00:08:14.834
How do you feel?
- Warm.

00:08:14.834 --> 00:08:17.417
(upbeat music)

00:08:25.396 --> 00:08:29.235
- Hayden has been a crazy
driver the last time we came on.

00:08:29.235 --> 00:08:30.291
You going to drive better?

00:08:30.291 --> 00:08:31.124
- Yeah!

00:08:31.124 --> 00:08:32.345
- You sure?
- Yes.

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:33.526
- You sure?
- Yes!

00:08:33.526 --> 00:08:35.872
(exciting music)

00:08:35.872 --> 00:08:37.493
- [Evan] Are you ready?
- Yes!

00:08:37.493 --> 00:08:39.117
- [Evan] You ready?
- Yes!

00:08:39.117 --> 00:08:40.753
- [Evan] You ready?!
- Yes!

00:08:40.753 --> 00:08:42.632
- [Evan] Alright.

00:08:42.632 --> 00:08:43.465
- Are you ready?

00:08:43.465 --> 00:08:44.298
- You ready?

00:08:44.298 --> 00:08:45.793
- Yes!
- Let's go!

00:08:45.793 --> 00:08:47.246
Here's the thing, Hayden.

00:08:47.246 --> 00:08:48.871
- What?

00:08:48.871 --> 00:08:51.547
- Here's what I didn't tell you.

00:08:51.547 --> 00:08:55.645
I'm in charge of gas, and
you're in charge of steering.

00:08:55.645 --> 00:08:58.686
But I never take my foot off the gas.

00:08:58.686 --> 00:09:01.228
It's all go! Alright?

00:09:01.228 --> 00:09:04.487
This is the worst driving ever! (laughs)

00:09:04.487 --> 00:09:06.201
Look at how we're driving!

00:09:06.201 --> 00:09:08.951
(exciting music)

00:09:16.539 --> 00:09:18.660
(Evan and Hayden laughing)

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:21.709
- [Evan] Eyes on the
road! Hands on the wheel!

00:09:21.709 --> 00:09:23.376
We're alive, barely.

00:09:25.194 --> 00:09:26.444
Barely, barely.

00:09:27.721 --> 00:09:30.007
Was that fun? Huh?

00:09:30.007 --> 00:09:30.840
- Yeah.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.374
- Yeah? High five, mister.

00:09:33.374 --> 00:09:35.384
Boom! Good job.

00:09:35.384 --> 00:09:38.051
(elegant music)

00:09:59.427 --> 00:10:03.032
- [Evan] Nina's having fun. Go, Nina! Woo!

00:10:03.032 --> 00:10:05.551
What do you think, Stephanie?

00:10:05.551 --> 00:10:08.718
Nice. Hayden, what do you think? Nice.

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.723
(upbeat music)

00:10:16.791 --> 00:10:18.762
We're going to have my favorite ice cream.

00:10:18.762 --> 00:10:21.644
It's a twist, vanilla and
orange flavor together.

00:10:21.644 --> 00:10:23.144
Oh, yeah. Get it--

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:27.228
Nina, Nina likes to photobomb my shots.

00:10:27.228 --> 00:10:28.766
Nina's the photobomber, but we love her,

00:10:28.766 --> 00:10:31.609
and it's her birthday, so it's all good.

00:10:31.609 --> 00:10:32.854
Ice cream time!

00:10:32.854 --> 00:10:35.437
(bright music)

00:11:05.764 --> 00:11:07.558
- [Evan] Are you guys ready
for the last ride of the day?

00:11:07.558 --> 00:11:08.521
- [Kids] Yes.

00:11:08.521 --> 00:11:10.404
- [Evan] What are we going to do?

00:11:10.404 --> 00:11:12.908
- Buzz--
- [Evan] Buzz Lightyear!

00:11:12.908 --> 00:11:14.658
- Toy Story--
- [Evan] Toy Story!

00:11:14.658 --> 00:11:17.324
Let's go beat the Emperor Zerg! Ooh-rah!

00:11:17.324 --> 00:11:19.907
(gentle music)

00:11:21.573 --> 00:11:24.761
Nina has a special message
for Believe Nation.

00:11:24.761 --> 00:11:25.594
- Believe.

00:11:25.594 --> 00:11:28.329
- [Evan] Believe, that's a good message.

00:11:28.329 --> 00:11:31.543
Okay, so, Nina's going to
do a rematch with Hayden.

00:11:31.543 --> 00:11:33.184
Nina wins every year, but maybe

00:11:33.184 --> 00:11:35.140
this is the year Hayden takes over.

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:36.987
And, Stephanie and Jeffery are going to

00:11:36.987 --> 00:11:39.086
battle each other out in their own car.

00:11:39.086 --> 00:11:42.233
This is a two handed game, so...

00:11:42.233 --> 00:11:43.853
I'm not going to film.

00:11:43.853 --> 00:11:45.436
I'm not going to film.

00:11:46.646 --> 00:11:49.714
I'm competitive; I need
to beat all these chumps.

00:11:49.714 --> 00:11:50.767
(Nina laughs)

00:11:50.767 --> 00:11:52.989
Got to beat all these chumps.

00:11:52.989 --> 00:11:55.066
So, I'm not going to film once we get in,

00:11:55.066 --> 00:11:57.702
but I'm predicting a victory. We'll see.

00:11:57.702 --> 00:12:00.285
(bright music)

00:12:01.904 --> 00:12:04.420
It's go time. Go time!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.920
Alright, final score: 224,400.

00:12:09.957 --> 00:12:13.380
Let's see how they'll-- 224,000.

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:14.800
We'll see.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:15.633
224

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.424
How much did you get?

00:12:18.424 --> 00:12:19.839
- She got...

00:12:19.839 --> 00:12:20.672
1,000...

00:12:22.147 --> 00:12:23.283
- [Evan] 1,000?

00:12:23.283 --> 00:12:25.642
- 400 and something,

00:12:25.642 --> 00:12:28.847
and I got 1,800 and something.

00:12:28.847 --> 00:12:30.726
- [Evan] 1,000?!

00:12:30.726 --> 00:12:32.775
- 18,000, 18,000.

00:12:32.775 --> 00:12:34.182
- [Evan] There's--

00:12:34.182 --> 00:12:36.682
(crowd noise)

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.570
- [Evan] Where am I?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.237
Oh yeah, there is the game face.

00:12:44.193 --> 00:12:46.457
Look at the game face.

00:12:46.457 --> 00:12:48.247
How much did you score?

00:12:48.247 --> 00:12:49.080
- 18,000.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.498
- [Evan] You got 18,000?

00:12:50.498 --> 00:12:51.331
- He got 18,000.

00:12:51.331 --> 00:12:52.872
- [Evan] You got 18,000?
And what did you get?

00:12:52.872 --> 00:12:55.888
- I got 1-4-4-0-0. 14,400.

00:12:55.888 --> 00:12:58.534
- [Evan] You got 14,000? What did you get?

00:12:58.534 --> 00:12:59.617
- Huh? 2,800.

00:13:00.557 --> 00:13:03.398
- [Evan] 2,000! What did Jeffery get?

00:13:03.398 --> 00:13:04.898
- 2,000 and seven.

00:13:07.712 --> 00:13:09.129
- [Evan] Alright.

00:13:10.397 --> 00:13:12.482
I don't think I want to say what I got.

00:13:12.482 --> 00:13:13.440
- [Hayden] What did you get?

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.810
- I'm not saying what I got.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:15.643
- [Hayden] Tell me!

00:13:15.643 --> 00:13:16.990
- [Evan] I'm not saying what I got.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:18.198
You don't want to know what I got.

00:13:18.198 --> 00:13:19.203
- [Hayden] Tell me, please.

00:13:19.203 --> 00:13:21.370
- I think Nina won. It's her birthday.

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:22.737
- Please tell me.

00:13:22.737 --> 00:13:23.857
- [Evan] You really want to know?

00:13:23.857 --> 00:13:24.690
- Yes. I really--

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:25.641
- [Evan] You really want to know?

00:13:25.641 --> 00:13:26.707
- I really want to know.

00:13:26.707 --> 00:13:28.540
- [Evan] I got 224,000

00:13:29.536 --> 00:13:30.369
- What?!

00:13:31.298 --> 00:13:32.498
- Yeah, but you know what?

00:13:32.498 --> 00:13:36.502
My machine was probably
broken or something.

00:13:36.502 --> 00:13:37.721
- Hah!

00:13:37.721 --> 00:13:40.219
- Thank you guys so much for joining us.

00:13:40.219 --> 00:13:42.469
Day four, Disney trip.

00:13:42.469 --> 00:13:46.395
Hope you had fun watching us having fun.

00:13:46.395 --> 00:13:49.013
We'll do it again, join us for day five.

00:13:49.013 --> 00:13:51.221
Thank you so much, continue to believe!

00:13:51.221 --> 00:13:52.893
Or whatever your one word is. And--

00:13:52.893 --> 00:13:53.976
- We'll see you soon!

00:13:53.976 --> 00:13:55.896
- Oh, wow, Nina jumping in.

00:13:55.896 --> 00:13:58.816
She's totally stealing
the spotlight, this Nina.

00:13:58.816 --> 00:14:01.259
Well, it's her birthday.
Wish Tina "Happy Birthday"

00:14:01.259 --> 00:14:02.234
in the comments, too.

00:14:02.234 --> 00:14:03.906
She deserves a happy birthday.

00:14:03.906 --> 00:14:04.989
See you guys.

